# Large raw datasets / archives & binaries
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.pbf
*.osm
*.parquet
*.joblib
*.xlsx
TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/huggingface/*.csv
TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/railway_network/railway_lines.geojson
