# But preserve manifests, reports, figures, scripts, tests, small sample CSVs, and gitkeep
!.gitkeep
!TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/standards/*.csv
!TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/accidents/*.csv
!TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/traffic/*.csv
!TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/weather/*.csv
!TrackPrior-AI/data/raw/railway_network/railway_stations.csv
!TrackPrior-AI/data/manifests/*.json
!TrackPrior-AI/reports/**

